name twig
Line (0.52,0.42)@20 - (0.68,0.26)@14 stroke=189,108,74
name light
Line (0.47,0.10)@6 - (0.47,0.86)@6 stroke=234,165,108
name knot
Circle (0.51,0.60) r=0.03 rgb=118,59,54
